The '''Braxant Run''' was a [[hyperspace route]] that ran throughout the northern part of the [[Outer Rim Territories]]. It met the [[Hydian Way]] at [[Bandomeer]].<ref name="RO World Locations" /> During the rule of the [[New Republic]], the portion of the Braxant Run that ran from [[Garqi]] to [[Agamar]], at which the route intersected with the [[Celanon Spur]], formed the northern boundary of the New Republic's territory of control.<ref name="Mando">''[[Star Wars: The Mandalorian Visual Guide]]''</ref>

